# Stomping Ground: declining to pay 2 life as it enters leaves it tapped and Bot1's life unchanged (CR 614.12a).

[Bot1 Deck]
Stomping Ground
Plains x19

[Bot2 Deck]
Plains x20

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Stomping Ground.Play
Bot1.Decline
? Bot1.Battlefield.Stomping Ground.Tapped = true

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield.Stomping Ground.Tapped = true
